{"seq":5,"slug":"influence-and-legacy","title":"苏格拉底·influence-and-legacy","stage":"DONE","category":"socrates","categoryLabel":"苏格拉底","chapterCount":3,"docCount":6,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy","rating":{"composite":3.87,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":3.6,"coverage":3.75,"positioning":4.67,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":null},"hubDir":"/Users/wangyang.learnwy/learnwy/learnwy/l-doc-hub/hubs/famous-people/20_socrates/5_influence-and-legacy","introHtml":"<p>本部分追溯苏格拉底（约前 470—前 399）从古代到当代的影响与遗产：苏格拉底式转向如何成为西方哲学的分水岭、经柏拉图—亚里士多德谱系与希腊化诸学派如何奠定西方哲学根基、&quot;哲学殉道者&quot;的象征如何形成，以及苏格拉底方法在今日教育与心理治疗中的制度化与误用。</p>\n<p><strong>本 hub 与兄弟 hub 的分工</strong>：本部分讲的是&quot;苏格拉底对后世产生了什么影响&quot;（历史接受与遗产），不重复其本人的思想与生平。具体而言——他的方法与学说原意见 <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a>；生平、审判与死亡的史实见 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a>；著作问题（不著一字、苏格拉底问题）见 <a href=\"../major-works/\">主要著作</a>；史料可靠性与各种争议（他有罪吗、牛虻还是精英）见 <a href=\"../controversies-and-appraisal/\">争议与评价</a>；&quot;转向哲学、奠基者&quot;等核心贡献的定性见 <a href=\"../core-contributions/\">核心贡献</a>。本 hub 在涉及这些主题时一律以相对路径交叉链接，不另行展开。</p>\n<p><strong>推荐学习路径</strong>：先读兄弟 hub <a href=\"../ideas-and-methods/\">思想与方法</a> 与 <a href=\"../life-and-times/\">生平与时代</a> 建立基础，再按以下顺序读本部分——</p>\n<ol>\n<li><a href=\"father-of-philosophy/the-socratic-turn\">苏格拉底式转向</a>：影响的起点，理解&quot;分水岭&quot;的实质与史料证据。</li>\n<li><a href=\"father-of-philosophy/pre-and-post-socratic\">前苏格拉底与后苏格拉底</a>：这一分期术语的史学来源与争议。</li>\n<li><a href=\"lineage/plato-and-aristotle\">柏拉图与亚里士多德</a>：三代师承谱系如何奠定西方哲学。</li>\n<li><a href=\"lineage/the-hellenistic-schools\">希腊化诸学派</a>：旁支谱系与&quot;一源多流&quot;。</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-model/the-philosophical-martyr\">哲学的殉道者</a>：殉道象征与&quot;良知 vs 法律&quot;难题。</li>\n<li><a href=\"enduring-model/the-socratic-spirit-today\">今日的苏格拉底精神</a>：当代制度化运用与误用，全部影响的收束。</li>\n</ol>\n<p><strong>前置知识</strong>：了解古希腊城邦、伯罗奔尼撒战争的基本背景，以及柏拉图、亚里士多德的大致身份，有助于理解本部分；不熟悉者可先读 <a href=\"../life-and-times/athens-and-youth/a-son-of-athens\">生平与时代·雅典与少年</a>。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"father-of-philosophy","title":"Father Of Philosophy","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-socratic-turn","title":"苏格拉底式转向","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy/the-socratic-turn"},{"seq":2,"slug":"pre-and-post-socratic","title":"前苏格拉底与后苏格拉底","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/father-of-philosophy/pre-and-post-socratic"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"lineage","title":"Lineage","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"plato-and-aristotle","title":"柏拉图与亚里士多德","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage/plato-and-aristotle"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-hellenistic-schools","title":"希腊化诸学派","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/lineage/the-hellenistic-schools"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"enduring-model","title":"Enduring Model","docCount":2,"url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/enduring-model","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"the-philosophical-martyr","title":"哲学的殉道者","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/enduring-model/the-philosophical-martyr"},{"seq":2,"slug":"the-socratic-spirit-today","title":"今日的苏格拉底精神","url":"/l-doc-books/c/people/socrates/influence-and-legacy/enduring-model/the-socratic-spirit-today"}]}]}